# Use the brownfield agent for system questions
For impact analysis or pull-request review, onboarding (how the system or a flow works), defect or incident triage, and requirement-gap questions about $project_name, use the `brownfield` custom agent: `kiro-cli chat --agent brownfield`, or pick `brownfield` in the agent selector. It answers narrow questions itself after reading the matched domains' reviewed rules, and delegates broad ones to a specialist ($specialists). The context is a map; the code is the truth.
If you already are $entry_agents or one of those specialists, ignore this note.
